{"meta":{"stage":"06-mirror-prs","source_org":"cyberfabric","target_org":null,"first_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:19:40Z","last_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:19:40Z"},"stats":{"total":68,"synced":0,"pending":0,"failed":0},"items":[{"source_pr_number":86,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/86","source_state":"closed","source_author":"ainetx","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #86] docs(core): update Python version requirement to 3.11+ and normalize …","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"v3.0.8-beta","pr_head_sha":"c96e799b6972bcebfa743b5bec1bdee2b7c00f2d","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"cyberfabric","pr_from_fork":0,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/86","id":3348424057,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ7VXwc7HlOV5","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/86","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/86.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/86.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/issues/86","number":86,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(core): update Python version requirement to 3.11+ and normalize …","user":{"login":"ainetx","id":244471386,"node_id":"U_kgDODpJWWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244471386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx","html_url":"https://github.com/ainetx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"…path placeholders to {cypilot_path}\r\n\r\nReplace Python 3.10+ references with 3.11+ throughout architecture docs to reflect `tomllib` stdlib requirement. Change hardcoded `.cypilot/` paths to `{cypilot_path}/` placeholder for consistency with configurable install directory (default: `cypilot/`). Update default install directory from `.cypilot` to `cypilot` in init command descriptions. Correct schema and artifact registry path references to\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Dual-mode CLI output (--json for machines, rich human UI otherwise); interactive editor \"modify\" during kit migrations; new commands (generate-agents, spec-coverage, kit install/update/migrate, generate-resources, migrate, migrate-config, update) and OpenAI option.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * CLI rebranded to \"cpt\"; per-project install path made configurable ({cypilot_path}); auto-regeneration of agent files on updates; version bumped; Python 3.11+ required.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * CLI docs, READMEs, SKILL and help output updated.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Expanded coverage for JSON help, human-mode UI, editor flows, agent regen.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-03-03T11:29:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T18:31:43Z","closed_at":"2026-03-03T18:31:23Z","merged_at":"2026-03-03T18:31:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"78405b16eb9d7c33e45e4b8201b8afc7964ffb35","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/86/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/86/comments","r