for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/list_ids.py` around lines 84 - 85,\nThe empty-result branch in list_ids.py calls ui.result({\"count\": 0,\n\"artifacts_scanned\": 0, \"ids\": []}) and returns, which omits the required\n\"status\" and \"_human_list_ids\" keys used by the human renderer; update that\nbranch so the payload includes \"status\": \"No IDs found\" (or similar) and a\n\"_human_list_ids\" string that renders the intended “No IDs found” view before\nreturning from the command (update the dict passed to ui.result in the function\nhandling list IDs).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-03T18:25:49Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T18:25:53Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/86#discussion_r2879856083","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/86","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2879856083"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/86#discussion_r2879856083"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/86"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2879856083/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":84,"original_start_line":84,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":85,"original_line":85,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":49,"position":49,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2879856092","pull_request_review_id":3884370982,"id":2879856092,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQ7VXwc6rpx3c","diff_hunk":"@@ -1,22 +1,27 @@\n import argpa