ctive and auto‑approve update modes; blueprint markers now support named IDs (required for new blueprints) while legacy syntax remains with deprecation warnings; identity-driven three‑way merges and explicit workflow/system‑prompt extraction.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Merge and validation improved to preserve user edits, handle legacy→named upgrades, anchor new inserts deterministically, and validate using complete instruction collections.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Expanded marker syntax/identity rules, migration guidance, per‑instruction traceability, fence‑aware TOC handling, and a core \"What's New\" ledger.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Version bumped to v3.0.7-beta; kit version updated.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-03-02T22:58:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T10:06:40Z","closed_at":"2026-03-03T10:04:23Z","merged_at":"2026-03-03T10:04:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"5f4c8ba4ba997db43aa94632efb7f6c91c4b9520","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/85/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/85/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/issues/85/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/statuses/642f958467c7bbe6eb9a941f7e48c7f83420ac5e","head":{"label":"cyberfabric:v3.0.7-beta","ref":"v3.0.7-beta","sha":"642f958467c7bbe6eb9a941f7e48c7f83420ac5e","user":{"login":"cyberfabric","id":249082402,"node_id":"O_kgDODtiyIg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/249082402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberfabric","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/c