ach finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn @.bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/blueprint.py around\nlines 108 - 109, The unclosed-marker error message should include the explicit\nmarker ID when present: update the error construction in the block that uses\nm_open, explicit_id and open_line (the logic around explicit_id =\nm_open.group(2) or \"\" and open_line) so that any raised error that currently\nformats the marker as \"@cpt:{type}\" or \"@/cpt:{type}\" instead includes the full\nmarker string with \":{id}\" when explicit_id is non-empty; locate the error\nraise/exception formatting in the function handling marker parsing (the code\nthat references m_open, explicit_id and open_line between the existing lines\n~118-129) and append or interpolate explicit_id into the marker text used in the\nerror message.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits 0e1e4ef to 21c8888","created_at":"2026-03-02T23:03:55Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T23:17:35Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/85#discussion_r2875133339","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/85","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2875133339"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/85#discussion_r2875133339"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/85"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2875133339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":108,"original_start_line":108,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":109,"original_line":109,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":35,"position":35,"subject_type":