rap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/kit.py`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/ADR.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/CODEBASE.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/DECOMPOSITION.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/DESIGN.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/FEATURE.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PR-CODE-REVIEW-TEMPLATE.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PR-REVIEW.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PR-STATUS-REPORT-TEMPLATE.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PRD.md`\n* `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/conf.toml`\n* `skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/__init__.py`\n* `skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/kit.py`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>💤 Files with no reviewable changes (6)</summary>\n\n* .bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PR-STATUS-REPORT-TEMPLATE.md\n* .bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PR-CODE-REVIEW-TEMPLATE.md\n* .bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/conf.toml\n* .bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/PR-REVIEW.md\n* .bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/CODEBASE.md\n* .bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/DECOMPOSITION.md\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThis PR bumps the module version to v3.0.5-beta in two locations and adds cleanup logic to remove stale `.prev` snapshot directories during kit installation and migration workflows. Multiple outdated blueprint files are removed from the `.prev` directory.\n\n## Changes\n\n|Cohort / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Version Bumps** <br> `.bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/__init__.py`, `skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/__init__.py`|Updated `__version__` from v3.0.4-beta to v3.0.5-beta in both locations.|\n|**Kit Cleanup Logic** <br> `.bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/kit.py`, `skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/kit.py`|Added `.prev` directory cleanup in `update_kit` after successful installation and in `migrate_kit` when no migration is needed (non-dry-run only).|\n|**Blueprint Deletions** <br> `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/blueprints/CODEBASE.md`, `DECOMPOSITION.md`, `PR-CODE-REVIEW-TEMPLATE.md`, `PR-REVIEW.md`, `PR-STATUS-REPORT-TEMPLATE.md`|Removed five blueprint/template documentation files containing SDLC workflow definitions, checklist configurations, and PR review templates.|\n|**Configuration Cleanup** <br> `.bootstrap/kits/sdlc/.prev/conf.toml`|Removed SDLC kit metadata block (version, slug, name) from configuration file.|\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~20 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 *Hop hop, version bumps complete!*  \n> *Old blueprints swept away so neat,*  \n> *Snapshot cleanup keeps things tidy,*  \n> *No stale .prev directories hidin',*  \n> *Cypilot's burrow, fresh and light!* 🥕✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 2 | ❌ 1</summary>\n\n### ❌ Failed checks (1 warning)\n\n|     Check name     | Status     | Explanation                                                                           | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :----------------: | :--------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ⚠️ Warning | Docstring coverage is 66.67% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (2 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name    | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                 |\n| :---------------: | :------- | :--------------------------------------