d -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn @.bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/migrate.py around\nlines 1486 - 1488, The call to process_kit currently discards its second return\nvalue (_errors) which lets migration proceed despite generation failures; change\nthe logic around process_kit(kit_slug, bp_dir, gen_kits_dir, dry_run=False) to\ncapture and handle the errors: inspect the returned _errors, and if non-empty,\nlog or raise an exception (e.g., raise a MigrationError or exit non-zero) with\ncontextual info (kit_slug, bp_dir) so migration halts and the failure is\nsurfaced instead of silently continuing.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 9886492","created_at":"2026-03-02T09:57:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T10:28:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871494674","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871494674"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871494674"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871494674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":1486,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":1488,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":68,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871494688","pull_request_review_id":3875136028,"id":2871494688,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQ7VXwc6rJ4gg","diff_hunk":"@@ -1469,6 +1554,83 @@ def _write_gen_agents(gen_dir: Path, project_name: str) -> None:\n # Migrate Config Flow (JSON → TOML)\n # ===========================================================================\n \n+# Key mapping for pr-review.json → pr-review.toml migration\n+_PR_REVIEW_KEY_MAP = {\n+    \"dataDir\": \"data_dir\",\n+    \"promptFile\": \"prompt_file\",\n+}\n+\n+# Path patterns to update in pr-review prompt entries\n+_PR_REVIEW_PATH_REWRITES = [\n+    (\".core/prompts/pr/\", \".gen/kits/sdlc/scripts/prompts/pr/\"),\n+    (\"prompts/pr/\", \".gen/kits/sdlc/scripts/prompts/pr/\"),\n+]\n+\n+\n+def _normalize_pr_review_data(data: Dict[str, Any]) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n+    \"\"\"Normalize pr-review.json keys and paths for v3 TOML format.\n+\n+    - Renames camelCase keys to snake_case (dataDir → data_dir, promptFile → prompt_file)\n+    - Rewrites prompt file paths from v2 locations to .gen/kits/sdlc/scripts/prompts/pr/\n+    \"\"\"\n+    out: Dict[str, Any] = {}\n+    for k, v in data.items():\n+        new_key = _PR_REVIEW_KEY_MAP.get(k, k)\n+        if new_key == \"prompts\" and isinstance(v, list):\n+            out[new_key] = [_normalize_pr_review_entry(entry) for entry in v]\n+        else:\n+            out[new_key] = v\n+    return out\n+\n+\n+def _normalize_pr_review_entry(entry: Any) -> Any:\n+    if not isinstance(entry, dict):\n+        return entry\n+    out: Dict[str, Any] = {}\n+    for k, v in entry.items():\n+        new_key = _PR_REVIEW_KEY_MAP.get(k, k)\n+        if isinstance(v, str):\n+            for old_pat, new_pat in _PR_REVIEW_PATH_REWRITES:\n+                if old_pat in v:\n+                    v = v.replace(old_pat, new_pat)\n+                    break","path":".bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/migrate.py","commit_id":"c1375d35ca633cfe3ff6838c909de87ba310ae7c","original_commit_id":"c1375d35ca633cfe3ff6838c909de87ba310ae7c","user":{"login":"co