\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/migrate.py` around lines 1332 - 1334,\nThe regeneration step is currently swallowing process_kit errors inside\n_regenerate_gen_from_config so migration can wrongly report success; update\n_regenerate_gen_from_config to check the process result and never discard\nfailures from process_kit (e.g., check return code / raised exception from\nprocess_kit.run), log stderr/stdout and raise a clear exception (or return a\nfailure) when the generation fails so callers (the migration flow that calls\n_regenerate_gen_from_config) will abort; ensure the same behavior applies to the\nother call site that invokes _regenerate_gen_from_config so generation errors\npropagate instead of being ignored.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 9886492","created_at":"2026-03-02T09:57:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T10:28:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871494735","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871494735"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871494735"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871494735/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1351,"original_start_line":1332,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":1353,"original_line":1334,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":24,"position":46,"subject_type":"line"},{"