w_key = _PR_REVIEW_KEY_MAP.get(k, k)\n+        if isinstance(v, str) and new_key == \"prompt_file\":\n+            for old_pat, new_pat in rewrites:\n+                if old_pat in v:\n+                    v = v.replace(old_pat, new_pat)\n+                    break","path":".bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/migrate.py","commit_id":"8ab9fa93954abece56e49d11d9aeffe67795b113","original_commit_id":"9886492e36145d838777b69b00ab4125f4116f52","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**Make `prompt_file` path rewriting idempotent.**\n\nAt Line 1620+, already-normalized `.gen/kits/{slug}/.../prompts/pr/...` values can be rewritten again because `prompts/pr/` still matches, producing duplicated path segments.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>💡 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        if isinstance(v, str) and new_key == \"prompt_file\":\n+        if isinstance(v, str) and new_key == \"prompt_file\":\n+            target_prefix = f\".gen/kits/{kit_slug}/scripts/prompts/pr/\"\n+            if target_prefix in v:\n+                out[new_key] = v\n+                continue\n             for old_pat, new_pat in rewrites:\n                 if old_pat in v:\n                     v = v.replace(old_pat, new_pat)\n                     break\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn @.bootstrap/.core/skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/migrate.py around\nlines 1620 - 1624, The prompt_file path rewrite is not idempotent: in the block\nthat checks if isinstance(v, str) and new_key == \"prompt_file\" and iterates\nrewrites (using variables v, rewrites, old_pat, new_pat) you should skip\nperforming a replacement when the target pattern is already present to avoid\nduplicating segments; change the logic to only replace if old_pat in v AND\nnew_pat not in v (or ensure the replacement results in no duplicated segment by\nnormalizing and checking) so the operation is safe to run multiple times without\nproducing repeated \"prompts/pr/...\" fragments.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits 9e00495 to 31cd4bb","created_at":"2026-03-02T10:35:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T11:05:21Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871673252","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871673252"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871673252"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/