              pass\n+                data = _normalize_pr_review_data(data, kit_slug=kit_slug)\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/migrate.py` around lines 1687 - 1690,\nrun_migrate_config calls _normalize_pr_review_data which currently rewrites\nprompt paths using a hardcoded \"sdlc\" kit slug; change the normalization to\nderive the kit slug from the incoming data (e.g., read data[\"kit\"] or a sensible\nexisting key) and pass that kit_slug into _normalize_pr_review_data or have\n_normalize_pr_review_data detect it, and use that dynamic kit_slug when\nrewriting paths instead of the literal \"sdlc\" so projects that use a different\nkit slug keep correct .gen/kits/<kit_slug>/... paths.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-02T11:34:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T11:34:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871938087","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871938087"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/82#discussion_r2871938087"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/82"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871938087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1725,"original_start_line":1687,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":1728,"original_line":1690,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":223,"position":278,"subject_type":"line"}],"source_reviews":[{"id":3875136028