_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/issues/81","number":81,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: add multi-repo workspace federation support","user":{"login":"nonameffh","id":5434885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzQ4ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5434885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh","html_url":"https://github.com/nonameffh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nonameffh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implement workspace configuration that federates multiple repos for cross-repo artifact traceability. Each repo keeps its independent adapter; a workspace manifest maps named sources and their roles (artifacts, codebase, kits, full). The primary source is always determined by cwd — no explicit primary field needed.\r\n\r\nKey changes:\r\n- WorkspaceConfig, SourceEntry, find_workspace_config() discovery\r\n- WorkspaceContext wrapping CypilotContext with remote SourceContexts\r\n- CLI commands: workspace-init, workspace-add, workspace-add-inline, workspace-info\r\n- Cross-repo ID resolution in validate, list-ids, where-defined, where-used\r\n- Optional `source` field on Artifact, CodebaseEntry, Kit (v1.2)\r\n- JSON schemas for workspace config and updated artifacts registry\r\n- Workspace workflow, skill routing, CLISPEC, and README docs\r\n- 34 new workspace tests; all 675 tests pass\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Multi-repo workspace support: workspace-init/add/info/sync, standalone or inline configs, Git-backed sources with local caching and per-source status.\n  * validate and list-ids gained --local-only and --source flags for scoped, workspace-aware operations.\n  * Artifact metadata now supports per-source attribution and cross-repo duplicate-ID detection.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Comprehensive workspace specs, workflows, CLI reference, and architecture guidance added.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Extensive tests covering workspace flows, resolution, sync, and cross-repo validation.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-02-27T12:05:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T08:59:59Z","closed_at":"2026-03-16T08:59:59Z","merged_at":"2026-03-16T08:59:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"62246352a16e10d4007e5a508d6eebebcc6cf742","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"pr0tey","id":1847966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDc5NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1847966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey","html_url":"https://github.com/pr0tey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pr0tey/events{/privacy}","received_eve