ode and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/where_defined.py` around lines 78 -\n87, The cross-repo scanning block in where_defined.py ignores the workspace\nsetting for remote ID resolution; update the condition so it also checks the\nWorkspaceContext.resolve_remote_ids flag before iterating remote sources. In\nother words, change the guard around ctx.cross_repo to require\nctx.resolve_remote_ids (e.g., if isinstance(ctx, WorkspaceContext) and\nctx.cross_repo and ctx.resolve_remote_ids) so that the loop over ctx.sources and\nthe use of sc.meta.iter_all_artifacts() is skipped when remote ID resolution is\ndisabled.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit d05f461","created_at":"2026-03-02T10:32:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T11:27:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2871652977","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871652977"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2871652977"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871652977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":78,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":87,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":32,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871652981","pull_request_review_id":3875309383,"id":2871652981,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQ7VXwc6rKfJ1","diff_hunk":"@@ -65,11 +66,26 @@ d