ines 11 -\n229, The review asks you to add `@cpt-`* traceability markers to the new init\nworkflow; update cmd_workspace_init and helper _infer_role by inserting short\n`@cpt-`* comments at each major algorithm/flow segment (e.g., start of scanning\nloop over entries, v3 discovery block where _read_cypilot_var is used, fallback\nfind_cypilot_directory branch, the \"skip current project\" check, the inline\nwrite branch that reads/writes core.toml, and the standalone\n.cypilot-workspace.toml write branch) so each segment has a unique marker (for\nexample `@cpt`:workspace-scan, `@cpt`:workspace-v3-discover,\n`@cpt`:workspace-fallback-discover, `@cpt`:workspace-skip-self,\n`@cpt`:workspace-inline-write, `@cpt`:workspace-standalone-write, and\n`@cpt`:infer-role) placed as comments immediately above the corresponding code\nblocks (functions cmd_workspace_init and _infer_role) to satisfy the\ntraceability guideline.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 53f02bf","created_at":"2026-03-02T10:32:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T11:54:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2871653015","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871653015"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2871653015"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871653015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":11,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":229,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","ori