resolve_remote_ids=false by constructing a\nWorkspaceContext (or loading a ws_cfg) with\ntraceability.resolve_remote_ids=False and ensure get_all_artifact_ids only\ncollects IDs from the primary source and ignores remote sources (reference:\nget_all_artifact_ids, resolve_artifact_path). 3) test scan-failure diagnostics\nby mocking scan_cpt_ids to raise an exception for a particular artifact path and\nasserting get_all_artifact_ids continues without crashing and does not add IDs\nfrom that artifact (reference: scan_cpt_ids used in get_all_artifact_ids). Use\ntemporary directories/files and mocks for find_cypilot_directory and\nload_artifacts_meta to simulate adapter presence/absence and to control\nmeta.iter_all_artifacts outputs.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-02T10:32:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T10:32:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2871653020","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871653020"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2871653020"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871653020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":250,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":367,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":197,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2871653026","pull_request_review_id":3875309383,"id":2871653026,"node_id":"PRR