ngth of output: 1998\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nrg \"resolve_remote_ids\" . --type py -C 3\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 4209\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ngrep -n \"def \" \"./skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/context.py\" | head -20\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 1277\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nsed -n '264,310p' \"./skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/context.py\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 2076\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ngrep -rn \"resolve_remote_ids\" ./skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/ --type py\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 184\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nsed -n '100,180p' \"./skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/context.py\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 3597\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nrg \"resolve_remote_ids\" -C 5\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 7303\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncat \"./tests/test_workspace.py\" | grep -A 20 \"resolve_remote_ids\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 990\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nsed -n '264,310p' \"./skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/context.py\" | grep -n \"cross_repo\\|resolve_remote_ids\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 97\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nrg \"get_all_artifact_ids\" -C 5\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 1018\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\nsed -n '250,310p' \"./skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/context.py\"\n```\n\nRepository: cyberfabric/cyber-pilot\n\nLength of output: 2809\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Fix artifact path resolution to not fall back to local filesystem when `source` is set but unresolved.**\n\nThe fallback at line 263 silently resolves remote artifacts to the local filesystem when the source is either missing or unreachable, producing incorrect ID resolution results. When `artifact.source` is explicitly set, treat unresolved sources as unavailable instead of falling back to `fallback_root`.\n\nAdditionally:\n- `get_all_artifact_ids()` ignores the `resolve_remote_ids` configuration flag (only checks `cross_repo`), allowing remote ID collection even when disabled.\n- Exception handling at lines 277 and 304 silently swallows scan failures without indication.\n- New workspace functions `resolve_artifact_path` and `get_all_artifact_ids` lack `@cpt-*` markers required by the Python file coding guideline.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/utils/context.py` around lines 257 - 263, The\ncurrent resolve_artifact_path implementation falls back to the local\nfallback_root when artifact.source is explicitly set but the named source is\nmissing or unreachable; change resolve_artifact_path so that if artifact.source\nis truthy and either not in self.sources or sc.reachable is False it returns\nNone (or a clearly unavailable sentinel) instead of resolving to fallback_root,\nand add the required `@cpt-`... header markers to the resolve_artifact_path\nfunction; update get_all_artifact_ids to respect the configuration flag\nresolve_remote_ids (only collect remote IDs when resolve_remote_ids is True in\naddition to cross_repo), add the required `@cpt-`... marker to\nget_all_artifact_ids, and stop silently swallowing exceptions in the scan logic\n(remove broad except blocks or re-raise/log errors with context so scan failures\nare visible rather than ignored).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit b456721","created_at":"2026-03-02T10:32:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T20:31:32Z","h