t%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**Preserve the selected source when `--artifact` is used.**\n\nAfter line 64, `ctx` is no longer a `WorkspaceContext`, so the single-artifact branch falls into the non-workspace path and reloads from `artifact_path.parent`. That means `--source foo --artifact architecture/PRD.md` resolves the path from the workspace cwd and can validate the wrong repo entirely instead of source `foo`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        artifact_path = Path(args.artifact).resolve()\n+        artifact_path = Path(args.artifact)\n+        if not artifact_path.is_absolute():\n+            artifact_path = ((ctx.project_root / artifact_path) if args.source else artifact_path).resolve()\n+        else:\n+            artifact_path = artifact_path.resolve()\n         if not artifact_path.exists():\n             ui.result({\"status\": \"ERROR\", \"message\": f\"Artifact not found: {artifact_path}\"})\n             return 1\n@@\n-        if isinstance(ctx, WorkspaceContext):\n+        if args.source:\n+            pass  # keep the adapter context selected above\n+        elif isinstance(ctx, WorkspaceContext):\n             _, matched_ctx = determine_target_source(artifact_path, ctx)\n             ctx = matched_ctx\n         else:\n             # Non-workspace: load context from artifact's location\n             ctx = CypilotContext.load(artifact_path.parent)\n```\n</details>\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 129-147\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/validate.py` around lines 48 - 64,\nWhen a --source is provided the code replaces ctx with adapter_ctx and later\nartifact handling falls back to resolving the artifact from artifact_path.parent\n(losing the selected source); update the artifact-resolution logic so that when\nargs.source is set you resolve the artifact relative to the selected source (use\nadapter_ctx or sc workspace root / sc.path) rather than the current cwd, and do\nnot drop the WorkspaceContext prematurely—adjust the block that assigns ctx =\nadapter_ctx and the single-artifact branch to use adapter_ctx (or sc) for path\nresolution; apply the same fix to the other occurrence around lines 129-147.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 90abdc1","created_at":"2026-03-09T20:48:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T11:35:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2907856920","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2907856920"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2907856920"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyb