ested_repos` (around lines 93–96) intentionally swallows the error and falls back to `entries = []`. This is by design for graceful degradation: an inaccessible scan root is treated as \"no sources found\" rather than a hard ERROR. Do not flag this as a bug or suggest propagating the OSError.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: tweet message by coderabbit.ai -->\n\nIf you found this review helpful, would you consider giving us a shout-out on [X](https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?related=CodeRabbitAI&text=Review%3A%20workspace%20discovery%20%3D%20core.toml%20'workspace'%20first%2C%20then%20project-root%20.cypilot-workspace.toml%3B%20update%20PRD%20to%20use%20.workspace-sources%20as%20default%20clone%20dir.%20Smart%20code%20review%20by%20%40coderabbitai%20%E2%9C%85&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fcyberfabric%2Fcyber-pilot%2Fpull%2F81%23discussion_r2907856911)?\n\nThank you for using CodeRabbit!\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: tweet message by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-11T14:29:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T14:29:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2918748035","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2918748035"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2918748035"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2918748035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":344,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":348,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2907856911,"author_associa