nested repos found\" alternative flow remain\nunchanged; reference the UC-014 Preconditions block and the `workspace-init\n[--root DIR] ...` flow when making this edit.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-03-14T18:19:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T19:15:40Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2935616382","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2935616382"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2935616382"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2935616382/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":984,"original_start_line":984,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":997,"original_line":997,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":91,"position":91,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2935616383","pull_request_review_id":3949119923,"id":2935616383,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQ7VXwc6u-fN_","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,144 @@\n+{\n+  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n+  \"$id\": \"https://example.com/cypilot/workspace.schema.json\",\n+  \"title\": \"Cypilot Workspace Configuration (.cypilot-workspace.toml)\",\n+  \"description\": \"Federation layer for multi-repo workspace support. Maps named sources (repos) to local paths with roles. Standalone file uses TOML format.\",\n+  \"type\": \"object\",\n+  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n+  \"required\": [\"version\", \"sources\"],\n+  \"examples\": [\n+    {\n+      \"version\": \"1.0\",\n+      \"sources\": {\n+        \"docs-repo\": {\n+          \"path\": \"../docs-repo\",\n+          \"adapter\": \".bootstrap\",\n+          \"role\": \"artifacts\"\n+        },\n+        \"code-repo\": {\n+          \"path\": \"../code-repo\",\n+          \"adapter\": \".bootstrap\",\n+          \"role\": \"codebase\"\n+        },\n+        \"shared-kits\": {\n+          \"path\": \"../shared-kits\",\n+          \"role\": \"kits\"\n+        },\n+        \"remote-lib\": {\n+          \"url\": \"https://gitlab.com/team/lib.git\",\n+          \"branch\": \"main\",\n+          \"role\": \"codebase\"\n+        }\n+      },\n+      \"traceability\": {\n+        \"cross_repo\": true,\n+        \"resolve_remote_ids\": true\n+      },\n+      \"resolve\": {\n+        \"workdir\": \".workspace-sources\",\n+        \"namespace\": {\n+          \"gitlab.com\": \"{org}/{repo}\"\n+        }\n+      }\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"properties\": {\n+    \"version\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"minLength\": 1,\n+      \"description\": \"Schema version (currently '1.0')\"\n+    },\n+    \"sources\": {\n+      \"type\": \"object\",\n+      \"description\": \"Named source repositories in the workspace. Keys are human-readable names.\",\n+      \"additionalProperties\": {\n+        \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/source_entry\"\n+      }\n+    },\n+    \"traceability\": {\n+      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/traceability_config\"\n+    },\n+    \"resolve\": {\n+      \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/resolve_config\"\n+    }\n+  },\n+  \"$defs\": {\n+    \"source_entry\": {\n+      \"type\": \"object\",\n+      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n+      \"oneOf\": [\n+        {\n+          \"required\": [\"path\"],\n+          \"not\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"required\": [\"url\"]}, {\"required\": [\"branch\"]}]}\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"required\": [\"url\"],\n+          \"not\": {\"required\": [\"path\"]}\n+        }\n+      ],\n+      \"properties\": {\n+        \"path\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"minLength\": 1,\n+          \"description\": \"Local filesystem path to the source repo. Resolved relative to workspace file location.\"\n+        },\n+        \"adapter\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"minLength\": 1,\n+          \"description\": \"Path to adapter directory within the source repo (e.g., '.bootstrap'). Omit if repo has no adapter.\"\n+        },\n+        \"role\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"enum\": [\"artifacts\", \"codebase\", \"kits\", \"full\"],\n+          \"default\": \"full\",\n+          \"description\": \"Constrains what the source contributes. 'artifacts' = only artifacts, 'codebase' = only code, 'kits' = only kits, 'full' = everything.\"\n+        },\n+        \"url\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"minLength\": 1,\n+          \"description\": \"Git remote URL (HTTPS or SSH). Only supported in standalone workspace files, not inline config.\"\n+        },\n+        \"branch\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"minLength\": 1,\n+          \"description\": \"Git branch or ref to checkout. Defaults to HEAD when not specified.\"\n+        }","path":"schemas/workspace.schema.json","commit_id":"9f1bd09558f424b565e977a1d2160e7304c3390c","original_commit_id":"ed70b29788f350969c136e1d46992d66e4a85eb0","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt