 ...` can therefore hide an invalid workspace manifest.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@skills/cypilot/scripts/cypilot/commands/validate.py` around lines 125 - 133,\nThe workspace-config validation errors collected into ctx_errors (via ws_ctx,\n_find_ws, _ws_cfg and constraints_error) are later discarded when ctx_errors is\nrebuilt from the matched source context in artifact mode; preserve those\nworkspace errors by merging them instead of overwriting: locate the code that\nreassigns ctx_errors for artifact/matched-source handling (the reset that\nrebuilds ctx_errors) and change it to combine the newly computed matched-source\nerrors with the existing ctx_errors (e.g., extend or concatenate), or add the\nworkspace errors into the matched-source error list before assignment so\nworkspace manifest errors are not lost.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:grasshopper -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 68de967","created_at":"2026-03-14T18:19:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T19:30:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2935616385","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2935616385"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/81#discussion_r2935616385"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/81"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2935616385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":125,"original_start_line":125,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":133,"original_line":133,"side":"RIGHT","author_asso