ilding this?*\n+\n+- **PRD — Product Requirements Document**  \n+  Defines functional requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria. Answers: *What should be built?*\n+\n+- **ADR — Architecture Decision Record**  \n+  Captures architectural decisions, alternatives, rationale, and consequences. Answers: *Why was this technical decision made?*\n+\n+- **DESIGN — Technical Design Document**  \n+  Describes system architecture, components, APIs, and implementation approach. Answers: *How will it be built?*","path":"README.md","commit_id":"48e8d8e60be2f3cdea9c90ceb6d653bb6836986f","original_commit_id":"97d4f161c3af320a543db8636573247d0a378661","user":{"login":"ainetx","id":244471386,"node_id":"U_kgDODpJWWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244471386?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx","html_url":"https://github.com/ainetx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ainetx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Please add also for DECOMPOSITION and FEATURE","created_at":"2026-02-23T10:06:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T10:06:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/76#discussion_r2839984028","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/76","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2839984028"},"html":{"href":