line.svg\" height=\"10%\" alt=\"Grey Divider\">\n\n<h3>Walkthroughs</h3>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>Description</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n<pre>\n• Add comprehensive PR management script with GitHub integration\n  - Fetch PR metadata, diffs, and review comments from GitHub\n  - Generate status reports with severity assessment and action items\n  - Support for review threads, resolved comments, and conversation formatting\n• Create PR review and status workflows for Cypilot integration\n  - Define workflow routing for PR review, status, and list operations\n  - Implement read-only analysis with fresh data fetching on each request\n  - Support batch processing (ALL) with exclude list filtering\n• Add PR review templates and prompts for multiple artifact types\n  - Code review, design review, ADR review, and PRD review prompts\n  - Structured code review report template with reviewer analysis\n  - Status report template with action items and severity tracking\n• Integrate PR workflows into Cypilot skill with routing rules\n  - Add quick commands for listing and reviewing PRs\n  - Route PR review/status requests to dedicated workflows\n  - Include IDE and LLM model tracking in reports\n</pre>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Diagram</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n>\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  User[\"User Request<br/>review/status/list PR\"] --> Router[\"Cypilot Skill<br/>SKILL.md routing\"]\n  Router -->|list intent| ListCmd[\"pr.py list<br/>Quick command\"]\n  Router -->|review intent| ReviewWF[\"pr-review.md<br/>Workflow\"]\n  Router -->|status intent| StatusWF[\"pr-status.md<br/>Workflow\"]\n  ListCmd --> Output1[\"Open PRs list<br/>respects exclude_prs\"]\n  ReviewWF --> Fetch1[\"pr.py fetch<br/>GitHub data\"]\n  StatusWF --> Fetch2[\"pr.py status<br/>auto-fetch + report\"]\n  Fetch1 --> Analysis[\"LLM analysis<br/>with checklist\"]\n  Fetch2 --> Severity[\"Assess severity<br/>audit resolved\"]\n  Analysis --> ReviewReport[\".prs/ID/review.md<br/>with verdict\"]\n  Severity --> StatusReport[\".prs/ID/status-report.md<br/>with action items\"]\n  ReviewReport --> User\n  StatusReport --> User\n  Output1 --> User\n```\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://www.qodo.ai/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/light-grey-line.svg\" height=\"10%\" alt=\"Grey Divider\">\n\n<h3>File Changes</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>1. skills/scripts/pr.py\n <code>✨ Enhancement</code> <code> +940/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Comprehensive PR management script with GitHub integration\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-pilot/pull/64/files#diff-f5ea424a20140c4826489fb1dc7f543c39e74d090b0e830dca08f0789984f665'> skills/scripts/pr.py\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>2. prompts/pr/adr-review.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +13/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Architecture Decision Record review prompt template\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-pilot/pull/64/files#diff-1be822cc0135e1cc2dc14a08a9f97f326b23d28d2bf9fbfc4df7250b4e9bf32e'> prompts/pr/adr-review.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>3. prompts/pr/code-review.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +18/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Code review prompt with focus areas and guidelines\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-pilot/pull/64/files#diff-062ebb4468e06289e9ee0c9b9eb23ef739ce4feff40d621d85d8d88458be7cf6'> prompts/pr/code-review.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details><summary><ins><strong>View more (7)</strong></ins></summary><br/>\n<details>\n<summary>4. prompts/pr/design-review.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +18/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Design and architecture review prompt template\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-pilot/pull/64/files#diff-b615e423b2d51b274310ef4b58d2cea7b897bf2f66f6973e1d7d5f4b64d8735e'> prompts/pr/design-review.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>5. prompts/pr/prd-review.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +15/-0 