t PRs` or any PR listing intent — NEVER use `gh pr list`\n+ALWAYS run `python3 {cypilot_path}/skills/scripts/pr.py list` directly WHEN user invokes `cypilot list PRs` or any PR listing intent — NEVER use `gh pr list`\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@skills/cypilot/SKILL.md` at line 162, The text uses an undefined variable\n`{project_root}` in the instruction that runs `python3\n{project_root}/.cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py list`; fix this by either (A)\nadding a `{project_root}` entry to the Variables section (similar format to\n`{cypilot_path}` and `{cypilot_mode}`) or (B) replacing `{project_root}` with\nthe already-defined `{cypilot_path}` if they refer to the same location; update\nthe line in SKILL.md accordingly so the command reads either `python3\n{project_root}/.cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py list` with `{project_root}` defined\nin Variables or `python3 {cypilot_path}/.cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py list` if\nyou choose the replacement.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:puma -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 2366686","created_at":"2026-02-11T16:09:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T17:57:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/64#discussion_r2794146955","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/64","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794146955"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/64#discussion_r2794146955"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/64"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794146955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,