s against design and architecture best practices.\n+\n+Focus on:\n+- Alignment with existing architecture (see docs/ARCHITECTURE_MANIFEST.md)\n+- Trade-off analysis\n+- API contract consistency\n+- Security considerations\n+- Compliance with /docs/spec-templates/DESIGN.md template\n+- Find antipatterns\n+- Compare proposed design with existing industry patterns in SaaS platforms\n+- Compare proposed design with the best IEEE, ISO, and other industry standards\n+- Criticize the design\n+- Split by categories and rate every 1-10\n+\n+Use `docs/checklists/DESIGN.md` as the structured review guide.\n+Pay attention to the \"PR Review Focus (Design)\" section at the end of the checklist.","path":"prompts/pr/design-review.md","commit_id":"a1ce6b83e73c88a16432f8e269c4ee77cb0e3858","original_commit_id":"e4e64c42967ff9f20d952d2def8a69f4d21e1e43","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"fixed. review again","created_at":"2026-02-11T17:53:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T17:53:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/64#discussion_r2794667312","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/64","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794667312"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/64#discussion_r2794667312"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/64"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794667312/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"start_line":1,"original_start_line":1,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":18,"original_line":18,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2794146934,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":18,"position":18,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794667758","pull_request_review_id":3786341187,"id":2794667758,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQ7VXwc6mkz7u","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@\n+# Requirements Review Prompt\n+\n+Review the following PR changes against requirements/PRD best practices.\n+\n+Focus on:\n+- Completeness and clarity of requirements\n+- Testability and acceptance criteria\n+- Traceability to business goals\n+- Compliance with /docs/spec-templates/PRD.md template\n+- Ensure requirements are aligned with the best industry standard practices for large SaaS systems and platforms\n+- Criticize requirements\n+- Split by categories and rate every 1-10\n+\n+Use `docs/checklists/PRD.md` as the structured review guide.\n+Pay attention to the \"PR Review Focus (Requirements)\" section at the end of the checklist.","path":"prompts/pr/prd-review.md","commit_id":"a1ce6b83e73c88a16432f8e269c4ee77cb0e3858","original_commit_id":"e4e64c42967ff9f20d952d2def8a69f4d21e1e43","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://ap