ed** ✅ — using `{cypilot_path}/skills/scripts/pr.py` is the correct approach with the template variable.\n\nHowever, the **missing `pr-review.json` configuration file** issue remains unresolved. Line 44 still references:\n```markdown\n- **Config**: `{cypilot_adapter_path}/pr-review.json`\n```\n\nThis file doesn't exist in the repository, which will cause execution failures. You'll need to either:\n1. Create the `pr-review.json` file at the expected location, or\n2. Remove this config reference from the workflow documentation if it's not needed\n\nThe same issue also exists in `workflows/pr-review.md` (lines 48, 59, 83, 91).\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-11T18:09:10Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T18:09:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/64#discussion_r2794737029","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/64","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794737029"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pull/64#discussion_r2794737029"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/64"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794737029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":43,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":98,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2794147026,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":98,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-constructor/pulls/comments/2794759020","pull_request_review_id":3786458784,"id":2794759020,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQ7VXwc6mlKNs","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,940 @@\n+#!/usr/bin/env python3\n+\"\"\"PR review helper – fetch PR diffs, metadata, and generate status reports.\n+\n+Cypilot skill: lives in .cypilot/skills/scripts/pr.py\n+Resolves all paths relative to the project root (detected via git).\n+\n+All review is done in read-only mode: the script downloads diffs and\n+metadata from GitHub but never modifies the local working tree.\n+\"\"\"\n+\n+import json\n+import os\n+import re\n+import subprocess\n+import sys\n+\n+\n+def _find_project_root():\n+    \"\"\"Find project root via git rev-parse.\"\"\"\n+    try:\n+        result = subprocess.run(\n+            [\"git\", \"rev-parse\", \"--show-toplevel\"],\n+            capture_output=True, text=True,\n+        )\n+        if result.returncode == 0:\n+            return result.stdout.strip()\n+    except FileNotFoundError:\n+        pass\n+    # Fallback: three levels up from this script (.cypilot/skills/scripts/)\n+    return os.path.dirname(\n+        os.path.dirname(\n+            os.path.dirname(\n+                os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n+            )\n+        )\n+    )","path":"skills/scripts/pr.py","commit_id":"a1ce6b83e73c88a16432f8e269c4ee77cb0e3858","original_commit_id":"df59d93a7ecdf2f706e69152f32000604878d4da","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github